うな状況をお願いします。\n巫女装束　巫女装束は丈が短かったり肩に切れ込みがある創作特有のものではなく、正規の物をお願いします。\nその他　早合「http://www.xn--u9j370humdba539qcybpym.jp/part1/archives/35」、「https://www.meihaku.jp/arquebus-basic/matchlock-launchmethod/」を首から下げている。(または袈裟懸けで下げている)\n\n少し難しいかもしれませんが、何卒よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 330768, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ちりまん", "screen_name": "tiri_man", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1460474721511022592/iE9lZEFE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1150346467669766144/1775819175/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 724021, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "月夜星海", "screen_name": "hosi_huru_yoru2", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1925174105722269696/TocqU8ck.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1213468467191377923/1733499922/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 759022, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "七日", "screen_name": "nnk_e", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1640715753719746560/WRJHh7YL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1674901566/1769075876/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_ex